      "writtenOn": "2021-03-16T13:18:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Do I understand correctly that \"soongOutDir\" means out/ and not out/soong? Is that the standard nomenclature? (it\u0027s a little confusing, but if it\u0027s the well-known pattern, it\u0027s the well-known pattern)\n\nHow is \"out/soong\" called then?",
      "range": {
