      "writtenOn": "2021-03-16T13:33:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No. soongOutDir is \"out/soong\".\n\nThe nomenclature is not consistent and is confusing. e.g. I didn\u0027t realise until I started this that buildDir was \"out/soong\" (I always assumed it was just out/).\n\nI chose to use soongOutDir as it is more meaningful than \"buildDir\" and the soong/ui/build/config.go uses SoongOutDir() and OutDir() to refer to \"out/soong\" and \"out\" respectively.",
      "parentUuid": "ec147ea9_74dd7da8",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 904,
        "startChar": 32,
